decimal clothesPrice = 100m;
decimal bookPrice = 20m;

decimal totalCost = CalculateTotalCost(carPrice, clothesPrice, bookPrice);
Console.WriteLine($"The total cost of the purchase is {totalCost}.");
```

This will output: "The total cost of the purchase is 3220." since the car price was adjusted to meet the constraint.

