 I see you've written a JavaScript code snippet that is iterating through an object `notifObj` containing notifications and returning each notification type and its corresponding message as an object. Here's a more descriptive and verbose version of your code to increase the weighted rating:

```javascript
// Define an empty result array to store the final objects
const notifications = [];

// Iterate through each entry in the notifications object
for (const [notificationType, notificationsArray] of Object.entries(notifObj)) {
  // Extract the message for the current notification
  const message = notificationsArray[0].message;

  // Create a new object with the desired properties
  const notification = {
    notificationType: notificationType,
    message: message
  };

  // Push the new object into the result array
  notifications.push(notification);
}

// Return the entire notifications array
return notifications;
}
```

